Derived from StarRocks/starrocks-connector-for-apache-flink v1.2.15,
commit 9cfffceff54750a11e8504f26f78e4da8744eb1a, including its bundled
starrocks-stream-load-sdk source, under the Apache License 2.0.
Local modifications adapt the sink to Apache Flink 2.3 public Sink V2 APIs
and repair checkpoint state restoration, serialization, and commit failures.
Local code also provides bounded JDBC table scans through the Flink 2.3 Source API.

The upstream checkout did not contain a top-level NOTICE file. Original
copyright and license headers are preserved in vendored source files.
